---
title: Preorder & Pickup — Things 4 Good
description: Preorder six or more Things 4 Good candles and pick them up anytime at the sale. Fill out the form and Jamie emails you a payment link.
card:
  kicker: "Sale logistics"
  name: "Preorder, pickup, and payment."
  summary: "Ordering six or more? Reserve them, pick them up at the sale, and pay however is easiest."
  photo: preorder
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}

{% block content %}

<!-- ============================ HEADER ============================ -->
<section class="section page-head" id="head">
  <div class="hero-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <a class="back-link" href="/">&larr; Things 4 Good</a>
    <p class="eyebrow">Sale logistics</p>
    <h1 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,5.4vw,4rem);letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.02;max-width:18ch">Preorder, pickup, and payment.</h1>
    <p class="lead" style="margin-top:18px">{% if site.preorderSheet %}The {{ site.saleYear }} preorder form is open. Pick your scents, and Jamie will email you a payment link once your order is in.{% else %}This page is here for practical sale details. When the {{ site.saleYear }} candle lineup is ready, we&rsquo;ll share preorder timing, pickup notes, and payment options with Candle Fundraiser subscribers first.{% endif %}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================ PREORDER ============================ -->
<section class="section" id="preorder" style="padding-top:clamp(20px,3vw,32px)">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Preorder &middot; six or more</p>
      <h2 class="t">Planning a bigger order?</h2>
      <p class="lead">Ordering <b style="color:var(--ink)">six or more</b>? {% if site.preorderSheet %}The <a href="{{ site.preorderSheet }}" data-tinylytics-event="preorder.sheet" data-tinylytics-event-value="preorder-head" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--marigold-d);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">preorder form</a> is open.{% else %}The preorder sheet opens closer to the sale, and subscribers get it first.{% endif %} Smaller orders are always welcome right at the sale &mdash; no preorder needed. XL candles and the new scents we unveil at the sale are sale-only.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step reveal">
        <div class="num">1</div>
        {% if site.preorderSheet %}<h3>Fill out the form</h3>
        <p>Choose your scents and how many of each, and leave your name, email and phone. Maker Night candles are at the bottom.</p>
        {% else %}<h3>Watch for the sheet</h3>
        <p>We&rsquo;ll send the preorder sheet to subscribers once scents, hours, and pickup details are locked in.</p>{% endif %}
      </div>
      <div class="step alt reveal">
        <div class="num">2</div>
        <h3>We pour &amp; prep</h3>
        <p>We hand-pour your candles, set the wooden wicks, let them cure, and add Mazie&rsquo;s labels &mdash; all set aside with your name on them.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step reveal">
        <div class="num">3</div>
        <h3>Pick up at the sale</h3>
        <p>Collect your preorder anytime during the sale, <b>{{ site.saleDates | safe }}</b>. The form stays open until the sale ends. Preorder donations are divided evenly across the four causes. {% if site.preorderSheet %}Jamie emails you a payment link once your order is confirmed.{% else %}Payment options are confirmed with the sale details.{% endif %}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mn-band reveal" style="margin-top:clamp(28px,4vw,40px)">
      <div class="glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="mn-copy">
        <span class="tag">{% if site.preorderSheet %}Preorder form &middot; open now{% else %}Preorder sheet{% endif %}</span>
        <h3>Ready to reserve your batch?</h3>
        <p>{% if site.preorderSheet %}Pick your scents, and we&rsquo;ll email a payment link.{% else %}The sheet opens closer to the sale and goes out to Candle Fundraiser subscribers first.{% endif %} Best for six or more, picked up anytime at the sale.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mn-act">
        {% if site.preorderSheet %}
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ site.preorderSheet }}" data-tinylytics-event="preorder.sheet" data-tinylytics-event-value="preorder-steps" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open the preorder form <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></a>
        {% else %}
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ site.updatesUrl }}" data-tinylytics-event="updates.click" data-tinylytics-event-value="preorder-steps" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get preorder updates <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></a>
        {% endif %}
        <span class="small">Or email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" style="color:var(--marigold);font-weight:700">{{ site.email }}</a></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================ PAYMENT ============================ -->
<section class="section section--paper2" id="payment">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">How to pay</p>
      <h2 class="t">Send your donation.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Each candle is a <b style="color:var(--ink)">$25 donation</b>. Pay however&rsquo;s easiest; Venmo is the most popular. On a phone, tap to open the app; on a computer, scan a code. Preorders pay once Jamie confirms the order.</p>
    </div>

    {% include "payment-methods.njk" %}

    <div class="good-note reveal" style="margin-top:clamp(28px,4vw,40px)">
      <span class="hand" style="font-size:1.7rem">100% &mdash; for real.</span>
      <span style="font-weight:500;color:var(--pine-d)">We cover every cost of making the candles ourselves, so the entire amount you send becomes a donation. Preorders are divided evenly across this year&rsquo;s four causes; choosing your own split is for purchases at the sale.</span>
    </div>

    <div class="sumstrip reveal" style="margin-top:clamp(22px,3vw,32px)">
      <div class="s acc"><b>$25</b><span>One candle</span></div>
      <div class="s"><b>$150</b><span>A batch of 6</span></div>
      <div class="s"><b>$250</b><span>Ten candles</span></div>
      <div class="s acc2"><b>100%</b><span>To charity</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================ CTA ============================ -->
<section class="section section--pine subscribe" id="cta">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center">Questions before you order?</p>
    <h2 class="t" style="max-width:20ch;margin-inline:auto">We&rsquo;re happy to help.</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="margin:18px auto 0;text-align:center">Get the fall announcement, read the common questions, or just reach out &mdash; a real Thing will answer.</p>
    <div class="sub-form" style="max-width:none;gap:12px">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ site.updatesUrl }}" data-tinylytics-event="updates.click" data-tinylytics-event-value="preorder-close" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get sale updates <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/faq/">Read the FAQ</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Email us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% endblock %}
